keep-ram-clean (2.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release.
  * Native Rust CLI and systemd daemon with PSI/cron trigger engine,
    cgroup v2 memory.reclaim, zram-aware swap flushing, open-file-safe
    tmpfs cleaner, pidfd-pinned process watchdog, interactive --watch
    dashboard, and CLI config manager.

